. ... The NAEP mathematics assessment measures students&#x27; knowledge and skills in mathematics and students&#x27; ability to apply their knowledge in problem-solving situations.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c8b68f8b3657cfb6\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.nationsreportcard.gov\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5af3d05ac24480d9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAnalysis of 2022 NAEP Mathematics and Reading Results\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5af3d05ac24480d9\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://whiteboardadvisors.com/analysis-of-2022-naep-mathematics-and-reading-results/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1f3299a6ab049999\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>Average eighth grade math score fell from 282 in 2019 to 274 in 2022</strong> – a decline of 8 points · 38% of eighth-graders performed below NAEP Basic, compared to 31% in 2019\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1f3299a6ab049999\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"October 24, 2022\",\n      \"siteName\": \"whiteboardadvisors.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "\"2022 NAEP\" grade 8 math Kentucky score 270", "provider": "brave", "count": 5, "tookMs": 834, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"996275088cee4e7e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nNAEP Report Card: 2022 NAEP Mathematics Assessment\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"996275088cee4e7e\">>>", "url": "https://www.nationsreportcard.gov/highlights/mathematics/2022/", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"5296fe23e4fe21eb\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n<strong>The average eighth-grade mathematics score decreased by 8 points compared to 2019</strong> and was lower than all previous assessment years going back to 2003. In 2022, fourth- and eighth-grade mathematics scores declined for mo