ps://www.nationsreportcard.gov/mathematics/states/groups/?grade=8", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2cbc673a9593dd1a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWhile average scores decreased between 2019 and 2022 for almost all student groups nationally, this overall pattern differed across the states. Compared to 2019, <strong>female students scored lower in 38 states in 2022, whereas male fourth-graders scored lower in 26 states</strong>.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2cbc673a9593dd1a\">>>", "siteName": "www.nationsreportcard.gov"}]}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1775280959801}}
