{"type": "message", "id": "68d9df9d", "parentId": "7d65009c", "timestamp": "2026-04-04T05:37:35.157Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_a74b80e62d644d6fb405d357", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"Realtor.com median listing price Kentucky January 2023\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1446,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"69145748256a8474\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHenderson County home listings had higher prices in January\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"69145748256a8474\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.thegleaner.com/story/news/local/2024/02/05/what-are-homes-selling-for-in-henderson-kentucky/72456409007/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"768eb923e0c0aa54\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe median home in Henderson County listed for <strong>$216,425</strong> in January, up 0.7% from the previous month&#x27;s $215,000, an analysis of data from Realtor.com shows. Compared to January 2023, the median home list price increased 1.3% from $207,400.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"768eb923e0c0aa54\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 5, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.thegleaner.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"177c0a7f844b47d9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMarket Statistics | Northern Kentucky Association of REALTORS\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"177c0a7f844b47d9\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://nkar.com/market-statistics/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3110ab5818c1aa6b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNKY Residential Year over Year Statistical Comparison 2022 v 2023 Residential 2023 Sales Stats by SIC\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3110ab5818c1aa6b\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"nkar.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"52628d8f8ef102d5\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHousing Inventory: Median Listing Price in Kentucky (MEDLISPRIKY) | FRED | St. Louis Fed\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"52628d8f8ef102d5\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/MEDLISPRIKY\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fddc546d0994751c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe median listing price in a given market during the specified month. With the release of its September 2022 housing trends report, Realtor.com® incorporated a new and improved methodology for capturing and reporting housing inventory trends and metrics. The new methodology updates and improves the calculation of time on market and improves handling of duplicate listings.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fddc546d0994751c\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"December 12, 2025\",\n      \"siteName\": \"fred.stlouisfed.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d95f945feb59ce97\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMedian home prices in Central KY hit all-time high: report | Lexington Herald Leader\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d95f945feb59ce97\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.kentucky.com/news/local/article288149000.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"93f75f3929cb6d24\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe graphic shows a snapshot of Central Kentucky’s housing market as of March 2024. Bluegrass Realtors · In Fayette County, the median home price rose even higher, to $315,287 in March, up from <strong>$275,000 in March 2023</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"93f75f3929cb6d24\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"May 2, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.kentucky.com\"\n  